<h1 class="sr-only">undefined · imiab 的个人博客</h1>
<div class="issue-line"><span>随笔 / 解题 / 实验</span><span>NOTES FROM THE IN-BETWEEN</span><span><%= page.current === 1 ? 'LATEST ENTRIES' : 'PAGE ' + page.current %> ↓</span></div>
<section class="entries" id="entries"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">01 / ENTRIES</span><h2>记录<span class="serif-italic"> / entries</span><sup><%= String(site.posts.length).padStart(2, '0') %></sup></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="<%- url_for('/archives/') %>">全部文章 <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="entries-grid"><div class="entry-list"><% page.posts.each(function(post, i) { %><article class="entry"><div class="entry-index"><span><%= String((page.current - 1) * config.index_generator.per_page + i + 1).padStart(2, '0') %></span><small><%= date(post.date, 'YYYY') %></small></div><div class="entry-main"><div class="entry-meta"><time datetime="<%= date_xml(post.date) %>"><%= date(post.date, 'MM.DD') %></time><span class="meta-rule"></span><% if (post.categories.length) { %><% post.categories.each(function(cat) { %><a href="<%- url_for(cat.path) %>"><%= cat.name %></a><% }) %><% } else { %><span>FIELD NOTES</span><% } %><span class="reading-time"><%= noise_reading_time(post.content) %> MIN READ</span></div><h3><a href="<%- url_for(post.path) %>"><%= post.title %><span class="entry-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></h3><p class="entry-summary"><%= noise_summary(post, 112) %></p><div class="entry-tags"><% post.tags.limit(4).each(function(tag) { %><a href="<%- url_for(tag.path) %>"># <%= tag.name %></a><% }) %></div></div></article><% }) %><%- partial('_partial/pagination') %></div><aside class="home-sidebar"><div class="editor-note"><span class="eyebrow">THE AUTHOR / 00</span><a class="author-name" href="<%- url_for('/about/') %>">imiab<span>↗</span></a><p>CTF、Pwn、逆向分析<br>与开发中的一些记录。</p><div class="author-stamp" aria-hidden="true"><span>u / d</span><small>未定義</small></div><div class="author-count"><b><%= String(site.posts.length).padStart(2, '0') %></b><span>篇记录<br>持续整理中</span></div></div><div class="sidebar-topics"><div class="sidebar-heading"><span class="eyebrow">BY SUBJECT / 按主题</span><a href="<%- url_for('/tags/') %>" aria-label="查看所有标签">↗</a></div><% site.tags.sort('length', -1).limit(8).each(function(tag) { %><a class="topic-link" href="<%- url_for(tag.path) %>"><span><%= tag.name %></span><small>[ <%= String(tag.length).padStart(2, '0') %> ]</small></a><% }) %></div><a class="rss-note" href="<%- url_for('/atom.xml') %>"><span class="rss-icon" aria-hidden="true">◔</span><div><b>RSS / Atom</b><small>订阅文章 ↗</small></div></a></aside></div></section>
